## @file
#  G0245D physical keypad device library (v92).
#
#  Reads every key straight from PM8994 over the self-written, bounded
#  Msm8996SpmiLib.  NO XBL / SMEM / DAL / PlatformInfo dependency -- see
#  g0245d/PITFALLS.md D3/D4 for why lifting vendor DXEs is fatal here.
#
